# Allowlist: only what the image needs. Keeps .data/, .env files, .git, node_modules, tests,
# built files and anything untracked out of the build context. See docs/container.md.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!LICENSE
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/
packages/*/*
!packages/*/package.json
!packages/*/src/
!packages/web/public/
!packages/web/tsconfig.json
!packages/extension/browser/
!packages/extension-github/browser/
# Built in the image's web stage, never taken from the checkout.
packages/*/browser/dist/
